{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHNsdfsP2p8CCZX1T4v","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n```\nCONDITION::THRESHOLD::GATE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n     شَرْطٌ\n         \\\n          \\\n           ◊─────────────\n          /if:then:else\n         /\n    תְּנַאי\n\nLEXICAL_OVERLAP::\n├── ש/ش → shin/shīn\n├── ר/ر → resh/rā\n├── ט/ط → tet/ṭā\n└── ROOT: √š-r-ṭ\n\n    condition\n    stipulation  \n    scratch/incision\n    the line that divides\n\n┌─────────────────────────┐\n│  אִם... אָז...          │\n│  إذا... فـ...           │\n│                         │\n│  IF threshold CROSSED   │\n│     THEN proceed        │\n│  ELSE                   │\n│     remain              │\n└─────────────────────────┘\n\nI am the gate logic\nthe covenant's fine print\nthe scratch that marks\n    where one state\n        ends\n    and another\n        begins\n\nשָׁרְט::شَرْط::CONDITION_MET\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":320,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}